2.1.evidence:
implement coordination of the implementation of policies, programs and activities for the protection of women among Regional Apparatuses;
1. To make effective and ensure the implementation of protection as referred to in Article 11 paragraph (1), the Regional Government shall establish institutions for the protection of women and children as follows:
Integrated Service Center for Women and Children Empowerment (P2TP2A) at the Regional level;
Integrated Service Center (PPT) at the Sub-district Level; and
Task Force for the Protection of Women and Children at the Village/Sub-district Level.

2.1.evidence_original:
melaksanakan koordinasi pelaksanaan kebijakan, program dan kegiatan  perlindungan perempuan antar Perangkat Daerah;

1. Untuk mengefektifkan dan menjamin pelaksanaan perlindungan  sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 11 ayat (1), Pemerintah Daerah  membentuk lembaga perlindungan perempuan dan anak sebagai berikut:

Pusat Pelayanan Terpadu Pemberdayaan Perempuan dan Anak (P2TP2A)  di tingkat Daerah;

Pusat Pelayanan Terpadu (PPT) Tingkat Kecamatan; dan

Gugus Tugas Perlindungan Perempuan dan Anak Tingkat  Desa/Kelurahan.
